import turtle

screen = turtle.Screen()

screen.bgcolor("light blue")
screen.setup(700,400)

bob = turtle.Turtle()
bob.color("red")
bob.circle(50)

turtle.done()

You can change:

* "light blue" to "yellow", "pink", "green", etc.
* 700,400 to any size you like.

import turtle

screen = turtle.Screen()
